# Assets must round-trip byte-for-byte on every platform.
#
# SVG is text, so without this git rewrites its line endings on a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf). A checked-in icon then differs by a CR from the
# identical icon inside node_modules, and the bundler refuses to write two
# different sources to one output file. Marking these binary stops any
# conversion, on any platform, whatever the developer's git config.
*.svg   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
